---
import { withBase } from '../../data/base';
import Reveal from '../site/Reveal.astro';
---

<Reveal class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-20">
  <h2 class="display max-w-[22rem] text-display text-ink">
    One developer,<br /><em class="italic">four codebases.</em>
  </h2>

  <div class="max-w-[38rem] space-y-6 text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-body">
    <p>
      MezuTech is one person. I pick problems I have myself — reading scripture
      without losing the thread, studying without lying to yourself about the
      hours, reading four hundred applications for one role — and build the
      narrowest app that solves them.
    </p>
    <p>
      All four are still in progress, and the pages say so. Nothing on this
      site claims a user count, a rating or a launch date it has not earned.
      When an app ships, its page will change.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href={withBase('/about')} class="link-rule text-ink">More about how I work</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Reveal>
